      "text": "[Direction 1 Inbound - Step 1] IAM Workload Identity Federation + STS\n- Pool: external-3p-agent-pool | Provider: external-3p-oidc-provider\n- Exchanges RS256 OIDC JWT at sts.googleapis.com/v1/token (RFC 8693)\n- Grants roles/aiplatform.user to federated principal://... (Zero Static Keys)",
