      "text": "[Direction 2 Outbound - Step A] Agent Registry (us-central1)\n- google_agent_registry_service (A2A_AGENT_CARD; omit top-level interfaces)\n- Auto-ingests into agents/agentregistry-{uuid}\n- Resolved once at startup via registry.list_agents() + get_remote_a2a_agent()",
