      "originalText": "[Direction 2 Outbound - Step B] Agent Identity Auth Manager + Binding\n- google_agent_identity_auth_provider (stores 3P OAuth / Bearer API Key)\n- google_agent_registry_binding links Source ReasoningEngine URN -> 3P URN\n- CredentialManager.register_auth_provider(GcpAuthProvider())",
