      "text": "[Direction 2 Outbound - Step C] Agent Gateway (AGENT_TO_ANYWHERE Egress)\n- Default-deny IAP v2 proxy (iap.googleapis.com/resources.egressViaIAP)\n- IAM UAP scoped to destination.agent_registry.service.name\n- AuthzPolicy allowlists *.googleapis.com + *.mtls.googleapis.com (avoid HTTP 498)",
